{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924300/extras/c09e8c2eb91cb4d1e5aeb56a6a682279.avif?t=1771675013\" width=558 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the contamination, an epidemic has broken out \u2013 zombie cats have taken over the entire town and are wreaking havoc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last survivor, once a member of an elite cat sniper unit. The cat army has dropped ammunition supplies \u2013 these can be found in wooden crates. Your mission is to eliminate all infected cats and cleanse the city. Go, cat soldier! Meow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Kitties: Zombie Hunter is a hidden object game \u2013 the player's task is to find cats hidden on the map. The game features a zombie apocalypse style, but with a touch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 200 zombie cats hiding in the ruins, and your task is to find them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a bonus, there are also 30 Halloween pumpkins scattered throughout the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All graphics are cute &amp; cozy and also hand-drawn.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You found a scary pumpkin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924300/f99e73aaf7e0eab6f7b67cd6957cca70c61cac0f.jpg"},{"name":"You found a scary pumpkin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924300/f99e73aaf7e0eab6f7b67cd6957cca70c61cac0f.jpg"},{"name":"You found a scary pumpkin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924300/f99e73aaf7e0eab6f7b67cd6957cca70c61cac0f.jpg"},{"name":"You found a scary pumpkin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3924300/f99e73aaf7e0eab6f7b67cd6957cca70c61cac0f.jpg"},{"na